WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.755
Learn also gives you a sample alert:
three short queries over the sign-in logs,

2
00:00:04.755 --> 00:00:09.087
and portal steps to turn them into an
alert rule where any result fires.

3
00:00:09.087 --> 00:00:11.922
Those queries only exist
inside the web page,

4
00:00:11.922 --> 00:00:16.749
so the repository pins the page's source,
unmodified, with a hash a test checks,

5
00:00:16.749 --> 00:00:20.426
and a weekly watch that reports
when Microsoft changes it.

6
00:00:20.426 --> 00:00:25.413
A small harness then runs the sample's
filters over a handful of fictional log rows,

7
00:00:25.413 --> 00:00:29.300
so you can see exactly what the
sample catches and what it misses.

8
00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:31.510
It's a test, not a query engine.
